SUMMARY:Thunder Thursdays
DESCRIPTION:One World West is excited to present a new Thursday Residency – Thunder Thursdays! A new project featuring the joint forces of Alex Bazemore and Hannah Ramsey\, alongside Joey Remillard and JC Hannon of Strictly Liquid!\nExpect fresh sets each week\, with new takes on old tunes from your favorite artists\, and perhaps even some original tunes! We’ll be bringing out the BOOM!\n\nSee ya there!\n\n\n$10 Cover\n\n\nWith two unique locations\, built inside buildings that were previously cast aside\, One World brews with the intention of fostering nourishing interaction and artistic cultural experiences. From live music to art shows\, “One World Brewing” is born from the magic that happens when the whole becomes greater than the sum of its parts. Our taprooms are intersections for people of all walks of life and different corners of the globe\, enjoying this time and place together.  Check out our upcoming schedule: click here
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/thunder-thursdays/2026-07-16/
LOCATION:One World Brewing – West\, 520 Haywood Rd\, Asheville\, North Carolina\, 28806
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Live Music
